  "kademe": 2,
  "zorluk": 2,
  "soru": "Antarktika kıyılarında yaşayan canlıların beslenme ilişkisi şemada gösterilmiştir. Oklar enerjinin yenen canlıdan yiyen canlıya akış yönünü gösterir.\n**Şemada üretici ile 2. basamak tüketici sırasıyla aşağıdakilerden hangisidir?**",
  "gorsel": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 465 72\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Fitoplankton, krill, penguen ve leopar foku besin zinciri\"><defs><marker id=\"ok226\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"152\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#ok226)\"/><line x1=\"213\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"245\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#ok226)\"/><line x1=\"321\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"353\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#ok226)\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"21\" width=\"107\" height=\"30\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"var(--dolgu)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"63.5\" y=\"41\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Fitoplankton</text><rect x=\"155\" y=\"21\" width=\"55\" height=\"30\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"var(--dolgu)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"182.5\" y=\"41\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Krill</text><rect x=\"248\" y=\"21\" width=\"70\" height=\"30\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"var(--dolgu)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"283\" y=\"41\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Penguen</text><rect x=\"356\" y=\"21\" width=\"99\" height=\"30\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"var(--dolgu)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"405.5\" y=\"41\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"currentColor\">Leopar foku</text></svg>",
